  "description": "UNLEIN® Utilities is a production-ready helper suite for .NET 6+/8+/9+ that removes boilerplate from everyday services. It ships:\n\n- Cryptology helpers for one-way/two-way hashing, secure tokens, and key-based encryption/decryption\n- File utilities for pre-upload metadata, Base64 generation, safe renaming, and instant uploads\n- Cookie manager plus string, collection, validation, math/finance, and date/time extension packs\n- Database stack with shared connections, retries, dynamic mapping, DataSet/DataTable helpers, and bulk insert\n- Lightweight logger with rolling files, API client with auto logging + telemetry, global error handler, retry policies, cache, and formula solver\n- NEW ObjectMapper for reflection-based auto mapping with naming transforms, skip-null semantics, and collection projections\n- NEW JsonSerialization layer for camel/snake/kebab/lower/upper naming when serializing or deserializing\n- README-backed docs, samples, and ready-to-ship configuration baked into the NuGet package\n\nAbout UNLEIN® Private Limited:\n- Focus on developer productivity tooling\n- Builds cloud-friendly solutions that balance performance and simplicity\n- Offers enterprise support, architectural guidance, and consulting for adopters\n- Trusted by fintech, ecommerce, and SaaS teams to keep pipelines resilient\n\nDrop it in, go to production, and publish to NuGet with confidence—UNLEIN® handles the plumbing while you focus on product.",
